    ['Critical discourse analysis exposes how state propaganda subtly manipulates semantic categories to manufacture compliance.', 'Scholarly linguistic analysis showing how news headlines trick populations.', 'School', 'Semantic', 'Relating to meaning in language or logic', 'Compliance', 'The state or fact of according with or meeting rules or standards'],
    ['The literary scholar scrutinized the dialectical interplay between determinism and human agency in naturalist tragedy.', 'Analyzing whether doomed tragic characters have free will or are trapped by fate.', 'School', 'Determinism', 'The doctrine that all events, including human action, are ultimately determined by causes', 'Agency', 'Action or intervention, especially such as to produce a particular effect'],
    ['Neuropharmacological research indicates that psychedelic compounds stimulate rapid dendritic arborization and synaptic plasticity.', 'Brain studies showing how specialized compounds prompt nerve branches to regrow.', 'Health', 'Dendritic', 'Relating to or having branches like a tree, especially of a nerve cell', 'Neuropharmacological', 'Relating to the scientific study of the effects of drugs on the nervous system'],
