    ['Stringent fiduciary regulations penalize corporate officers who engage in deceptive insider trading maneuvers.', 'Laws imposing prison time on company executives who trade stocks on secret tips.', 'Work', 'Fiduciary', 'Involving trust, especially with regard to the relationship between a trustee and beneficiary', 'Maneuvers', 'Movements or series of moves requiring skill and care'],
    ['Ecological resilience theory demonstrates that biodiversity buffers biomes against irreversible catastrophic state shifts.', 'Complex ecosystems resist environmental collapses because diverse species protect each other.', 'Weather', 'Biomes', 'Large naturally occurring communities of flora and fauna occupying major habitats', 'Resilience', 'The capacity of a system to maintain functions and processes in face of disturbance'],
