    ['The chief executive officer outlined a comprehensive turnaround strategy to counteract catastrophic market share erosion.', 'A company leader detailing how to save a failing brand from bankruptcy.', 'Work', 'Erosion', 'The gradual destruction or diminution of something', 'Turnaround', 'An abrupt or unexpected change, especially one that results in a more favorable situation'],
    ['Cognitive reappraisal exercises empower individuals to attenuate acute amygdala reactivity during traumatic recalls.', 'Mental reframing techniques calming the brain\'s fear centers during panic memories.', 'Health', 'Attenuate', 'Reduce the force, effect, or value of something', 'Amygdala', 'A roughly almond-shaped mass of gray matter inside each cerebral hemisphere involved with emotion'],
    ['The appellate court reversed the lower ruling citing egregious procedural infractions during jury deliberations.', 'High court throwing out a bad verdict because a jury broke rules.', 'Everyday English', 'Egregious', 'Outstandingly bad; shocking', 'Infractions', 'Violations or infringements of a law or agreement'],
